{"title":"GATE 2027-Topicwise Test-10 (Engineering Mathematics -2)","fileName":"050_GATE 2027-Topicwise Test-10 (Engineering Mathematics -2).html","branch":"ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING","series":"GATE 2027 Online Test Series - Electrical Engineering","provider":"MADE EASY","duration":2700,"questions":[{"qnum":1,"type":"MCQ","correct":"A","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>The general solution of partial differential equation given below is:</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/d0d7fa0127c7ebaaf2a88b936526ee50ccf287e2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div><p><img src=\"/media/306728946f71a59bae53b8ad6dfd8ff6611aa1e0.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div><p><img src=\"/media/27eb0f40383c3d5b010bebf27beac04ad32be8b0.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div><p><img src=\"/media/f53dcd08c0e072f8810a30541e8038990671bdd6.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div><p><img src=\"/media/443bdbe2529eb3ff4e00896509b5390fa8da4404.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p><img src=\"/media/aef4cdbf65cb463055df530c7e8e08eed49d33eb.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/0c6604523a3a12b64a536487aed4237b8020af65.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/9613d4977700bc082c5d12cc09ce1edd00d4b8d3.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"single | Marks +2 / -0.66"},{"qnum":2,"type":"MSQ","correct":"B,A,D,C","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>Select the incorrect statement(s) from the given below options.<br />A buffalo is tied with a pole of 200 m long rope. At some point of time,</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div><p>the probability that the buffalo is at least 50 m away from the pole is 1/4</p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div><p>the probability that the buffalo is within the distance of 40 m of the pole is 1/5</p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"<div><p>the probability that buffalo is at least 100 m away from the pole is 1/2</p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div><p>the probability that the buffalo is atmost 150 m from the pole is 3/4</p></div>","isCorrect":true}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>The buffalo can be anywhere within the circular area defined by the length of the rope (<em>R </em>= 200 m).<br />Let &lsquo;<em>x</em>&rsquo; denote the distance of the buffalo from the pole. The probability that the buffalo is within a certain distance &lsquo;<em>r</em>&rsquo; from the pole is proportional to the area of the circle with radius '<em>r</em>' divided by the total area of the circle with radius &lsquo;<em>r</em>&rsquo; i.e.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/e2f949582ad25b560a7eb2a4a109ef4cf0689563.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/f71b54cc0a631559020d67bef3dc5ef816500a9b.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"multi | Marks +2"},{"qnum":3,"type":"MSQ","correct":"B,A,D","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"/media/2d136233df2516422ae471dc4d4199fbdf2f0866.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div><p><img src=\"/media/54f57747b3d9c7f31c047de0ead3006eb4d40f3c.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div><p><img src=\"/media/768103a6d238e3cce1e3173463ccebe26af58396.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"<div><p><img src=\"/media/1d421b838cb43b31d835249eead71c8dab14a586.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div><p><img src=\"/media/fa742d347e42080e85e57aede5fa11c4ad2e7c99.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p><img src=\"/media/b9e0c688739a4ed4d590a04d83210e10f4cf5a86.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/4eab9e1c68a45959dd2df344fbaddaea0f936fe7.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"multi | Marks +2"},{"qnum":4,"type":"MCQ","corre